<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Support | My Little Wardrobe</title>
    <meta name="description"
          content="Get help with My Little Wardrobe, Premium purchases, restoring purchases, and your outfit album.">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #090b10;
            color: #f7f9fc;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
                         "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        main {
            width: min(860px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: 48px auto;
        }

        header,
        section {
            padding: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: #131823;
            border: 1px solid #252d3b;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .brand {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: #ff9fc2;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
        }

        p,
        li {
            color: #bbc5d5;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }

        p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        a {
            color: #a9c7ff;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        a:focus-visible,
        summary:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid #ff9fc2;
            outline-offset: 5px;
        }

        .contact-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 8px 0 16px;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            background: #ff9fc2;
            color: #241522;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .contact-button:hover {
            background: #ffb9d3;
        }

        ul,
        ol {
            padding-left: 24px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        details {
            padding: 18px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #252d3b;
        }

        summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        details p,
        details ol {
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .note {
            padding: 16px;
            background: #1b2230;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #a0adbf;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            main {
                margin: 20px auto;
            }

            header,
            section {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<main>
    <header>
        <p class="brand">My Little Wardrobe</p>
        <h1>How can we help?</h1>
        <p>
            Need help with the game, your Premium purchase,
            or a technical issue? Contact the developer below.
        </p>

        <a class="contact-button"
           href="mailto:gokmenkeser@hotmail.com?subject=My%20Little%20Wardrobe%20Support">
            Email Support
        </a>

        <p>
            <a href="mailto:gokmenkeser@hotmail.com">
                gokmenkeser@hotmail.com
            </a>
        </p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>Before you contact us</h2>
        <p>Please include the following details where possible:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Your device model and iOS or Android version.</li>
            <li>The installed version of My Little Wardrobe.</li>
            <li>A short description of the issue and how it happened.</li>
            <li>A screenshot, if it helps explain the problem.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="note">
            Parents and guardians should send support requests on behalf
            of children. Please do not send passwords, payment-card
            details, or a child's personal information. Hide sensitive
            information in screenshots.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

        <details>
            <summary>What is included for free?</summary>
            <p>
                The first five items in each category are free.
                Additional Premium items can be unlocked with an
                optional one-time purchase.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Is Premium a subscription?</summary>
            <p>
                No. Premium is a one-time purchase, not a subscription.
                It unlocks the game's Premium wardrobe items.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How do I restore my Premium purchase?</summary>
            <ol>
                <li>Connect your device to the internet.</li>
                <li>
                    Make sure you are using the same App Store or
                    Google Play account used for the original purchase.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Open the game's settings or purchase area and
                    complete the parental gate.
                </li>
                <li>Select Restore Purchases.</li>
            </ol>
            <p>
                Purchases are tied to the store where they were made.
                An Apple purchase cannot be restored through Google
                Play, or vice versa.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>I paid, but Premium items are still locked.</summary>
            <p>
                Check that the store shows the purchase as completed,
                rather than pending or cancelled. Restart the game
                while connected to the internet, then try Restore
                Purchases.
            </p>
            <p>
                If the issue continues, email support with your device
                details and the purchase date. Do not purchase again
                to troubleshoot. If proof of purchase is needed,
                redact unrelated personal and payment information.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How do I request a refund?</summary>
            <p>
                Payments and refund decisions are handled by the store
                where you made the purchase, under its refund policies.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    Apple:
                    <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/"
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        Request help with a purchase
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    Google Play:
                    <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637"
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        Refund information
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Where are my outfit photos saved?</summary>
            <p>
                Outfit pictures are saved in the game's album on your
                device. After selecting Ready, allow the photo capture
                to finish before leaving the result screen. Tap a
                saved picture in the album to view it larger.
            </p>
            <p>
                The album is not a cloud photo service. Deleting the
                app or clearing its storage may remove your saved
                outfits and pictures. Restoring Premium does not
                restore album photos.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>The game crashes or does not display correctly.</summary>
            <p>
                Close and reopen the game, restart your device, and
                check for an available game update and sufficient free
                storage.
            </p>
            <p>
                Avoid uninstalling the game as your first troubleshooting
                step, because local progress and album photos may be
                lost. If the issue continues, send us your device model,
                game version, and a screenshot or description.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Can I turn off music and sound effects?</summary>
            <p>
                Yes. The game provides separate controls for music
                and sound effects. If you cannot hear audio, also
                check your device's media volume and audio settings.
            </p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How can I ask a privacy question?</summary>
            <p>
                Email
                <a href="mailto:gokmenkeser@hotmail.com?subject=My%20Little%20Wardrobe%20Privacy">
                    gokmenkeser@hotmail.com
                </a>
                with the subject “My Little Wardrobe Privacy”.
                A parent or guardian may contact us about information
                relating to their child.
            </p>
        </details>
    </section>

    <footer>
        © 2026 Gökmen Keser · My Little Wardrobe
    </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
